{"section":{"id":"cet4-2025-06-set1-conversation-2","examId":"cet4-2025-06-set1","title":"对话 2","kind":"对话","start":651.71,"end":752.27,"preview":"Did you hear about Johnny?","lines":[{"start":651.71,"end":653.71,"text":"Did you hear about Johnny?"},{"start":653.71,"end":654.67,"text":"No. Why?"},{"start":654.67,"end":655.87,"text":"Is he okay?"},{"start":655.87,"end":658.11,"text":"He had some plastic surgery done."},{"start":658.11,"end":659.47,"text":"What? Why?"},{"start":659.47,"end":660.51,"text":"Do you remember?"},{"start":660.51,"end":662.59,"text":"He had a scar on his face."},{"start":662.59,"end":663.87,"text":"Yes, of course."},{"start":663.87,"end":665.15,"text":"He always had that."},{"start":665.15,"end":670.83,"text":"I've known him since primary school, and I always remember him having that on his cheek."},{"start":670.83,"end":673.23,"text":"Well, he had it fixed."},{"start":673.23,"end":674.99,"text":"Fixed? What do you mean?"},{"start":674.99,"end":677.47,"text":"You can't fix a scar."},{"start":677.47,"end":678.83,"text":"You know what I mean."},{"start":678.83,"end":685.71,"text":"He had an operation done on it, plastic surgery, in order to cover it and make it less noticeable."},{"start":685.71,"end":688.75,"text":"Oh, well, that's ridiculous, isn't it?"},{"start":688.75,"end":692.99,"text":"It was noticeable, sure, but it wasn't an ugly scar."},{"start":692.99,"end":697.15,"text":"It never occurred to me that he should have it taken care of like that."},{"start":697.15,"end":698.19,"text":"I agree."},{"start":698.19,"end":704.59,"text":"I can understand some scars and physical defects can be ugly and distracting, but not Johnny's."},{"start":704.59,"end":710.51,"text":"In fact, I thought it added character, like it gave him a certain uniqueness."},{"start":710.51,"end":712.75,"text":"He must have felt differently, though."},{"start":712.75,"end":717.31,"text":"He must have felt self-conscious, and insecure, perhaps."},{"start":717.31,"end":719.55,"text":"No, no, that's not the reason."},{"start":719.55,"end":721.87,"text":"He was totally fine with his scar."},{"start":721.87,"end":725.31,"text":"As you said, he had had it for most of his life."},{"start":725.31,"end":727.63,"text":"Then why did he have the operation?"},{"start":727.63,"end":730.35,"text":"Because his girlfriend wanted him to."},{"start":730.35,"end":730.83,"text":"What?"},{"start":730.83,"end":734.11,"text":"That's so superficial and selfish of her."},{"start":734.11,"end":740.75,"text":"If Johnny's girlfriend doesn't like him for who he is, then she does not deserve to be his girlfriend."},{"start":740.75,"end":741.63,"text":"You're right."},{"start":741.63,"end":744.59,"text":"So he is insane to give in to her like that."},{"start":744.59,"end":750.19,"text":"But when I told him, he said he loves her and would just do what she wants him to."},{"start":750.19,"end":752.27,"text":"What a fool he is."}],"audio":"assets/audio/8c4a1ae7daebe91ede1acf77376660858c5bf020f5624ff6e1a859a49b9d43a5.wav","audioOffset":651.71},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"Did you hear about Johnny?","start":651.71,"end":653.71,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes"},"chunks":[{"text":"Did you hear about Johnny?","start":651.71,"end":653.71,"visual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes"}}],"variants":{"overview":[{"text":"Did you hear about Johnny?","start":651.71,"end":653.71,"visual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes"}}],"standard":[{"text":"Did you hear about Johnny?","start":651.71,"end":653.71,"visual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes"}}],"fine":[{"text":"Did you hear about Johnny?","start":651.71,"end":653.71,"visual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes"}}],"micro":[{"text":"Did you hear about Johnny?","start":651.71,"end":653.71,"visual":{"type":"事件","icon":"shapes"}}]}},{"id":"1-0","text":"No.","start":653.71,"end":654.12,"legacyTaskIds":["1-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[1],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"否定","icon":"circle-x"},"chunks":[{"te